674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0icIFzHwu8QQ7kNvwHX3Bu3&_nc_oc=Ado0AMBISZhMaNvHU5ZndX_d4GpiILmmjcMD7ZWerPvqoAbvk0cnEW0ksDxELTTWLNc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBJnmWEmvxq7c0xnikTGWV_p8bbCiQCrtOwJqhXXHGP1g&oe=6A4E5F59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HLeAXPt4qsQQ7kNvwF-UQbg&_nc_oc=Adrp3-ckex3URv-8IV4S0-hQZiAe-Nizg1Am5YUNUZ6e3M5zRUQhoPnRHR1i1kdXL5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBcBs2hVI43YsRcxZwqvUXcydzgjUEQzXYDlulWs4rW1w&oe=6A4E6816"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E_IPzmpvM-QQ7kNvwGDadaD&_nc_oc=Adps1otB2xsYzPTvCeSO9TeV4rQA99NqrQekZNRsjquOeq9spb_P7rMyhLm-tx8FXX4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDHwVJAwi_5fWr2n75xYW06wiS8HBHmuEwIlSy0sgYbRQ&oe=6A4E6431"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip